{"title":"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/5/215f24838d24bf776509470fb14f84f323135643.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^{2}-3x+2)(x)(x-4)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"218\" height=\"19\" /> are:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/9/4f9755b9b12793ce42ba7cd14ae6ac9a631e5a8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 4\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 0\\text{ and }4\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 1\\text{ and }2\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 0,1,2\\text{ and }4\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 1,2\\text{ and }4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"588\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Factor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/7/1a7c8c7f6952759f4993d786ac5b8b9fae3780d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-3x+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"90\" height=\"16\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/5/2d5576c453bf87f36d1611f73a55c49d6684ed6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-2)(x-1).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"18\" /> The roots are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/f/e7f059c47255d2d2cbe6634ef1597ba377305a8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 0,1,2\\text{ and }4.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"140\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME\" title=\"1950 AHSME\">1950 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1950 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1950\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</